/A 1407 0 R
/Alt (The 10-panel scatter plot grid shows predicted biomass versus actual biomass for 10 different models, arranged in two rows of five. Each panel displays a scatter plot with a horizontal axis labeled Actual biomass and a vertical axis labeled Predicted biomass, both ranging from 0 to 10. A dashed diagonal line represents perfect prediction. Each panel also lists R squared, RMSE, and MAE values. Panel lm shows R squared 0.075, RMSE 1.524, MAE 1.213. Panel rf shows R squared 0.347, RMSE 1.28, MAE 0.993. Panel xgbTree shows R squared 0.268, RMSE 1.356, MAE 1.058. Panel gbm shows R squared 0.211, RMSE 1.409, MAE 1.108. Panel knn shows R squared 0.125, RMSE 1.513, MAE 1.177. Panel gam shows R squared 0.154, RMSE 1.458, MAE 1.155. Panel pls shows R squared 0.052, RMSE 1.542, MAE 1.228. Panel svmRadial shows R squared 0.2, RMSE 1.427, MAE 1.106. Panel cforest shows R squared 0.325, RMSE 1.307, MAE 1.021. Panel cubist shows R squared 0.317, RMSE 1.318, MAE 1.021. The scatter plots generally show a positive correlation, with varying degrees of spread around the dashed diagonal line, indicating moderate model performance.)
/K 2
/P 32 0 R
/Pg 22 0 R
/S /Figure
/Type /StructElem
>>
